'''Amelio Perez Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport d'Amelio Perez}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: AMP, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: AMIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Costa Yiren]], a community in the [[Baix Llevant]] comarca of [[Estret Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is named after [[Amelio Perez]], a governor of Estret Province who was assassinated in 1989. It is served by [[Aeroístmus]], which operates essential services from [[Cecilio Ríos International Airport|Sant Bart]].

